{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Words is a roguelike adventure about writing words... for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submit words to score big and defeat opponents. Buy sticker and stamps to change the rules of language, creating hundreds of thousands of synergies, and breaking the score ceiling with dizzying combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blaze a path through cursed bosses and uncover secret items and challenges that completely change the way the game is played. How about all consonants? Maybe all vowels? How about no letters at all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find ways to break the game open and change how you look at words forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 unique stickers and stamps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique characters who dramatically change the way you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 bosses to sabotage your runs, or be manipulated into multiplying your score even higher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique challenges that completely change the rules of the game</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856460?t=1759153650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856460/27c2acf263e6f56853c4d77589155de3d4ad5d28/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759153650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856460/a5f6a1f597e712f4ef93d46f823f9fbc6003ee0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759153650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856460/a5f6a1f597e712f4ef93d46f823f9fbc6003ee0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759153650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"